  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have learned the art of funneling necromantic power between yourself and your minions.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Death sphere (Necrotic Feeding (ghost strike)).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you use your Necrotic Feeding ghost strike, you may make either or both of the following choices:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>You may use Necrotic Feeding to consume a mindless undead you reanimated and control (regardless of its actual hit points); if you do, it automatically fails its saving throw.</li>\n<li>You may grant the bonuses gained from your Necrotic Feeding to an undead you control within your dominion range.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Only one creature can benefit from your Necrotic Feeding bonuses at a time, and additional uses of Necrotic Feeding overlap (do not stack).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/death#toc112\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
